{"time": 1769534928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951444206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "刚下飞机，还在机场买深夜档咖啡的莉维娅感受到了郊外有着非常强的魔力波动，有着不亚于神代的浓度。"}
{"time": 1769534984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631779545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，打算前去看看"}
{"time": 1769535014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615349934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "对此莉维娅的选择是？\n1、亲自过去看看\n2、派个使魔过去看看"}
{"time": 1769535034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378404028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（本来还想多几个选项的，那就两个了）"}
{"time": 1769535052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87352681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd2"}
