{"time": 1769615172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558960339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd70+30"}
{"time": 1769615172, "type": "reply", "message_id": "558960339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]演奏出: 1D70+30={48}+30=78"}
{"time": 1769615263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941682763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看着车窗外流光溢彩风景的莉维娅，在出租车接近水晶之丘大厦时，感知到了大厦顶部似乎有一丝很隐晦的魔力波动，是从者的气息。"}
{"time": 1769615283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128114579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧，这地还有从者?\""}
{"time": 1769615425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867484851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看来继续留在这里也没什么必要，既然是那家伙，干脆打个许久不用的电话问一问好了，call"}
{"time": 1769615440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815612798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（call哪位）"}
{"time": 1769615457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771367540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（横飞姬）"}
{"time": 1769615526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341948521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "电话很快就接通了，刚接通，那边就传来横飞姬迫不及待的声音。"}
{"time": 1769615563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231648671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“喂，是莉维娅吗？先不要说其他的了，你是圣杯战争的御主吗？有令咒吗？”"}
{"time": 1769615616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749693277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"令咒?\"抬起自己右手，看看手背，语气倒是波澜不惊，\"就想我也当御主?你已经是了吧？\""}
{"time": 1769615701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570003561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？既然这样那看来还是要等明天晚上呢…我也还没有获得御主资格，因为现在还是属于赝品的时间嘛～”"}
{"time": 1769615731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718838401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "电话那头传来俏皮的幼女声线，显得她有些失望。"}
{"time": 1769615794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168453207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“既然这样，你打电话过来有什么事要问我吗？还是说你已经有自己的计划了？”"}
{"time": 1769615855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955400082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"赝作?\"皱了皱眉，\"算了，我准备下榻的酒店已经有从者了，你知道是谁吧？\""}
{"time": 1769615911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389310876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就算是赝作，这次的规模。\"翻了个白眼，\"白天交战的从者?啧啧，你们的手笔也不小。\""}
{"time": 1769615921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875290772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦，是水晶之丘吗？我看看我看看，好像是Assassin呢。”"}
{"time": 1769615955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258178921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "追加判定，横飞姬知道莉维娅曾经混进去哈桑教团这件事吗？"}
{"time": 1769616042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707151740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1/3/5/7、不知道\n2/6/8知道混进去但是不知道干了啥\n4/9、知道大部分情况\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769616099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460600254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=389310876]（其实是晚上）"}
{"time": 1769616148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607782878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769616148, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1607782878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=7"}
{"time": 1769616178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397990283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嘛，就Assassin这种程度的从者，对你也没威胁吧。”"}
{"time": 1769616233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907223301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哈桑?\"稍微感兴趣了一些，\"行，我会去看看。\""}
{"time": 1769616248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006805814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明天我们要见个面吗？呵，我还在等你的招待。\""}
{"time": 1769616296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68475172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“行啊，我现在据点就在警察局大楼，离得还挺近的，期待与你的相见，老朋友。”"}
{"time": 1769616325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972545072", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "r60+40横飞姬和莉维娅的关系"}
